				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't know if I haven't got a copy of it and last time I asked somebody from Irvine and they said they didn't know of it so either it's just got lost which I can't believe or it's been bought out by some other department somewhere was defined in terms of improper improper improper Yes because he was a very pompous and selfabservant person So I'm told I never met him.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
