				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>The states is way ahead of Britain I know but aren't there restaurants where people can't smoke But it's not so easy to find them well it may be easier now than it was then but it's still not easier What about philosophers taking part who have smoke have their clothes reeking of smoke Yeah that's one for hours Bernard Williams claims that Popper was a fraud and that Bernard had carried out a ten minute conversation with Popper with a cigarette burning cigarette behind his back and Popper never complained about anything.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
