				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He had a rather dim view of Lauven Greece and in particular he was frightened that Lau would try to expand this into a discussion of Lau's own stuff or work by what the article that Lau was invited to write or had been invited to write That he would expand it on to what?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
