				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>He did something he thought it was complete in a sense he was provincial about his work Well I mean he had a series of programs and one was the program of incitability and the prime method for that would be the elimination of quantifiers and once he had settled that for real close to that's all there was to it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
