				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>One was a list of Taski's problems and the other was a list of the various decision procedures that had been well the quantifier eliminations that had been done by Tasky or under his patronage Dunler to Dunler undertook to do this to tackle these two things.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
