			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a67" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts132" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts133">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>All right and well send it to me Man I seem to recall something on the history model theory here in which Tarzabin worked had a central central place But was that this first thing you mentioned?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
